{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Ripple... ripple... rings on the pond.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Follow the water—our letters flow on.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A — Alder. Grow by the flow | roots by wet banks down low",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B is for Boat. A boat floats on water and carries people or things.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Catfish — remember C. Whiskers swish | barbels near the mouth of the fish",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "What drifts in with D? Dam! A dam holds back water and changes how it flows.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "By the water, E meets Eel. Slide with the tide | long body side to side",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F — Frog. It hops on land and swims with strong back legs.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G is for Green Algae. Green scene | soft patches grow between",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Heron — remember H. It stands very still, then steps through shallow water.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Ripple, ripple—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "River words come back to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "What drifts in with I? Iris! Wet-ground sight | iris flower opens bright",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "By the water, J meets June Bug. It is a shiny beetle that can fly on warm evenings.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "K — Kingfisher. Flash and splash | dive for fish, then back in a dash",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L is for Lily Pad. A lily pad floats flat on the water like a green plate.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Muskrat — remember M. Body low | paddle where bank waters flow",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "What drifts in with N? Nest! A nest is a place birds build to hold eggs and chicks.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "By the water, O meets Otter. Side to side | float, turn, dive and glide",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P — Pond. It is a small body of still water where plants and animals live.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q is for Quillwort. Quillwort low | spiky leaves in water grow",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Reed — remember R. It grows tall and straight at the water's edge.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "What drifts in with S? Salamander! Long and low | four legs help it go",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "By the water, T meets Trout. It swims in cool freshwater and flicks its tail against the current.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "Ripple, ripple—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "River words come back to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "U — Underwater Plant. Sway all day | underwater leaves bend this way",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V is for Vallisneria. Vallisneria is a ribbon-leaved freshwater plant that grows underwater.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Waterfall — remember W. Water falls tall | rushing sheet by rocky wall",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "What drifts in with X? X-ray Tetra! An X-ray tetra is a small translucent fish with a partly see-through body.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "By the water, Y meets Yellow Water Lily. Yellow in the light | broad leaves float, flower bright",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z — Zooplankton. Tiny drifting zooplankton ride along with moving water.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Ripple, ripple—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "River words come back to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "The ripple fades... now listen for what returns.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "A ... wait ... Alder! Reach both hands up like branches.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Remember B ... Boat! Row two slow strokes.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C? ... Catfish! Wiggle fingers like whiskers, then swim.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D ... Dam! Hold two palms together like a wall.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "E ... wait ... Eel! Wiggle one hand in a long curve.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Remember F ... Frog! Make one little finger-hop.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G? ... Green Algae! Wave fingers softly like green strands.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Find H ... Heron! Hold two fingers tall, then take one slow step.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "I ... wait ... Iris! Open your hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Remember J ... June Bug! Buzz your fingers in a small circle.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "K? ... Kingfisher! Make one quick hand-dive, then hold still.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Find L ... Lily Pad! Hold one flat palm like a floating leaf.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "M ... wait ... Muskrat! Paddle two fingers along an imaginary bank.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Remember N ... Nest! Cup both hands like a nest.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "O? ... Otter! Float both palms, then make one little dive.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Find P ... Pond! Make a small calm circle with both hands.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Ripple, ripple—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "River words come back to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... wait ... Quillwort! Spread fingers upward like spiky leaves.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Remember R ... Reed! Stand one hand tall, then sway.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "S? ... Salamander! Walk two fingers, then wiggle a tail.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Find T ... Trout! Flick one hand gently like a tail.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "U ... wait ... Underwater Plant! Sway both hands like underwater leaves.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Remember V ... Vallisneria! Sway one hand like a long ribbon leaf.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "W? ... Waterfall! Let both hands tumble gently downward.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Find X ... X-ray Tetra! Make a gentle fish-swim with one hand.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Y ... wait ... Yellow Water Lily! Hold one flat palm, then open a yellow flower.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Remember Z ... Zooplankton! Let fingertips drift slowly with the current.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Ripple, ripple—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "River words come back to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "Ripple quiet, A to Z.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "River words came home with me.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
